     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Hello  everyone,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">I am trying to generate heatmaps for my data and run in following problems. I would be grateful for some suggestions about heat map code. </span><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">I arranged matrix for the heatmap by myself and I would like to keep this not changed during heat map plotting. I tried both heatmap.2 (gplot) and geom_tile (ggplot2) with no luck to get what I want. heatmap.2 keeps the sort but layout is bad and ggplot2 reorganises data in the heat map.</span></font><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Can you suggest </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">how to switch off clustering in ggplot2?</span></div><div><br></div><div>Here is the code I used.<br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Generating heatmap with ggplot2 </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">```{r}</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">if (!require(&quot;reshape2&quot;)) {</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">install.packages(&quot;reshape2&quot;, dependencies = TRUE)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">library(reshape2)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">}</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">if (!require(&quot;plyr&quot;)) {</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">install.packages(&quot;plyr&quot;, dependencies = TRUE)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">library(plyr)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">}</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">if (!require(&quot;scales&quot;)) {</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">install.packages(&quot;scales&quot;, dependencies = TRUE)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">library(scales)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">}</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">if (!require(&quot;ggplot2&quot;)) {</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">install.packages(&quot;ggplot2&quot;, dependencies = TRUE)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">library(ggplot2)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">}</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">data.sorted.merged.test &lt;- data.sorted.merged[,-c(2:5,8)]</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">data.heatmap2 &lt;- melt(data.sorted.merged.test)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">data.heatmap2 &lt;- ddply(data.heatmap2, .(variable), transform,rescale = rescale(value))</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">ggplot(data.heatmap2, aes(variable, ID))+ geom_tile(aes(fill=rescale), colour=&quot;white&quot;) + </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"> scale_fill_gradient(low=&quot;white&quot;, high=&quot;red&quot;, breaks=colbreaks)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">```</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Also I can attach png files of the heat map if that can help.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Thanks very much for your help,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Jakub</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></span></div></div>"
